flowchart TB
  INPUT[业务输入：评论 / @ / DM / 主 Session / 视频事件]
  NORMALIZE[统一事件与身份标准化：channel / actorUid / eventId / target / contextRoot]
  IDENTITY[身份解析：owner / friend / stranger + friendDirectory]
  CHANNEL[通道授权：DM / atInvite / recommend / public publish]
  CONTEXT[SocialContextAssembler：构建带来源的 ContextEnvelope]
  subgraph EVIDENCE[按权限获取上下文]
    VIDEO[视频证据：标题 / 简介 / 字幕 / 目标楼层 / 热评]
    MEMORY[memoryRetriever：按 scene 与 visibility 取记忆]
    MEME[interactionMemeLookup：公开梗知识]
    REL[好友关系与偏好：仅私信或授权好友场景]
    PERSONA[persona / growth / personality / emotion]
  end
  PRIVACY[统一隐私与不可信输入策略：硬规则 + 场景白名单]
  AGENCY[自主意愿：dualContextAgency；不能替代通道授权]
  MODEL[统一模型路由：invokeInteractionPrompt / 专用 memory route]
  DECIDE{模型决策}
  ACTION[动作执行器：每个动作再次校验 UID / 开关 / 额度 / 目标]
  PLATFORM[Bili MCP / 专用 Python adapter：最终 allowlist / pause / receipt]
  RECEIPT[稳定回执与幂等键]
  EVENTS[InteractionEventCoordinator：持久化 outbox / 每个 sink 独立完成标记]
  subgraph PROJECTIONS[按事件类型与隐私分类投影]
    LIFE[LifeMemoryCoordinator：公开真实经历 → episode / candidate / interest]
    FRIEND[friendLearning / friendRelationships]
    COG[socialCognition]
    EMO[emotionalState：助手状态，不是用户心理诊断]
    TASK[recommendations / ownerTodos]
  end

  INPUT --> NORMALIZE --> IDENTITY --> CHANNEL --> CONTEXT
  CONTEXT --> VIDEO
  CONTEXT --> MEMORY
  CONTEXT --> MEME
  CONTEXT --> REL
  CONTEXT --> PERSONA
  VIDEO --> PRIVACY
  MEMORY --> PRIVACY
  MEME --> PRIVACY
  REL --> PRIVACY
  PERSONA --> PRIVACY
  PRIVACY --> AGENCY --> MODEL --> DECIDE
  DECIDE -->|reply / action| ACTION --> PLATFORM --> RECEIPT --> EVENTS
  DECIDE -->|skip| EVENTS
  EVENTS --> LIFE
  EVENTS --> FRIEND
  EVENTS --> COG
  EVENTS --> EMO
  EVENTS --> TASK

  subgraph OWNERONLY[主人私有通道例外]
    OWNER[已验证 owner UID]
    OWNERMEM[memoryRetriever.localContext(chat)：可读主人私有记忆]
    OWNERAGENT[ownerDmAgent：命令规划与普通聊天分流]
    OWNER --> OWNERAGENT --> OWNERMEM
  end
  INPUT --> OWNER

  classDef shared fill:#e8f2ff,stroke:#4777b8,color:#17365d;
  classDef policy fill:#fff1dc,stroke:#b27a27,color:#5a3b08;
  class CONTEXT,VIDEO,MEMORY,MEME,REL,PERSONA,LIFE,FRIEND,COG,EMO,TASK shared;
  class IDENTITY,CHANNEL,PRIVACY,AGENCY,ACTION,PLATFORM,RECEIPT,EVENTS policy;
